    TranslatableName: Cherenkov
    plainText: 1
  description:
    TranslatableName: "The Cherenkov engine from the Restock+ mod (by Nertea) is
      a 1.25\u202Fm nuclear thermal rocket that delivers 300\u202FkN of thrust and
      915\u202Fs of vacuum Isp, with a mass of about 3\u202Ft. It serves as a high\u2011power,
      long\u2011range interplanetary propulsion solution, bridging the gap between
      weaker nuclear engines and chemical rockets."
